  <!--
    The answer to dry ground. Vanilla's own solar condenser: a SolarArray charges it from
    daylight and a LiquidProducer turns that charge into fresh water in its own 128-dram tank,
    with no crew and no fuel - about a dram every hundred to four hundred turns. Because the
    scaffold dedicates any finished building that holds liquid, it joins the stores by itself.
    This is VISION's promise working as written: anything with vanilla parts is used by the
    settlement for free. It costs water to raise, which is the point - on a dry site the founder
    carries in the water that buys the thing that makes water.
  -->
  <building Key="condenser" DisplayName="solar condenser (makes water from daylight)" Blueprint="Solar Condenser" Cost="16" Ticks="2400" Styles="all" Category="storage" />
